      <div class="field field--name-field-page-content field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field--content field__items">
              <div class="field__item--text read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default"
      >
          
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p><em><strong>Acuut psychische hulp nodig? Bel naar </strong></em><a href="tel:+31407821277"><em><strong>(040) 782 12 77</strong></em></a><em><strong> of ga naar de pagina&nbsp;</strong></em><a href="https://www.ggze.nl/spoed"><em><strong>Spoed</strong></em></a><em><strong>!</strong></em></p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--text-titled read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default"
      >
          
            <h2 class="field field--name-field-text-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Ben je bekend bij GGzE? </h2>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Neem contact op met je behandelaar of begeleider of kies jouw optie:</p><ul><li>Volwassenen (23+): bel <a href="tel:+31402973300">(040) 297 33 00</a><br>Het nummer is bereikbaar op werkdagen tussen 08.30 uur en 17.00 uur.</li><li>Kind &amp; Jeugd (tot 23 jaar): bel <a href="tel:+31402613550">(040) 261 35 50</a> of <a href="mailto:zst-kj@ggze.nl">mail ons</a>.<br>Het nummer is bereikbaar op werkdagen tussen 08.30 uur en 17.00 uur.</li><li>Overige vragen: bel <a href="tel:+31402970170">(040) 297 01 70</a> of <a href="mailto:info@ggze.nl">mail ons</a>.<br>Het nummer is bereikbaar op werkdagen tussen 08.00 uur en 17.00 uur.</li></ul></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--reference-blocks read field__item">  <div class="paragraph--blue paragraph--1-items paragraph paragraph--type--reference-blocks paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
      <div class="field field--name-field-references field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item"><a href="/mail-ons-vertrouwelijk"  class="node--type-content-page node--view-mode-reference-block reference-block--internal">
  
            <h2 class="field field--name-field-reference-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Mail ons vertrouwelijk</h2>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-reference-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Je kunt <strong>Zivver </strong>gebruiken voor het vertrouwelijk verzenden van mails en bestanden aan GGzE.</p></div>
      

  <div class="reference-block__link"><span>Lees meer</span></div>
</a>
</div>
          </div>
  
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--text-titled read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default"
      >
          
            <h2 class="field field--name-field-text-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Ben je nieuw bij GGzE?</h2>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Onze medewerkers helpen je graag.</p><ul><li>Vragen over <strong>hulp</strong> of <strong>behandeling</strong>: bel <a href="tel:+31402967766">(040) 296 77 66</a> of <a href="mailto:entreeambulant@ggze.nl">mail ons</a>.<br>Het nummer is bereikbaar op werkdagen tussen 10.00 uur en 15.00 uur.</li><li>Vragen over <strong>opname</strong> of <strong>beschermd wonen</strong>: bel <a href="tel:+31402967855">(040) 296 78 55</a> of <a href="mailto:entreeklinisch@ggze.nl">mail ons</a>.</li><li>Overige vragen: bel <a href="tel:+31402970170">(040) 297 01 70</a> of <a href="mailto:info@ggze.nl">mail ons</a>.<br>Het nummer is bereikbaar op werkdagen tussen 08.00 uur en 17.00 uur.</li></ul><p>Bel je voor <strong>De Woenselse Poort</strong> of forensische polikliniek <strong>De Omslag</strong>?</p><ul><li>Vragen voor De Woenselse Poort: <a href="https://www.dewoenselsepoort.nl/contact/">Klik hier</a>.</li><li>Vragen voor forensische polikliniek De Omslag: bel <a href="tel:+31402967600">(040) 296 76 00</a> of <a href="mailto:omslagsecretariaat@dewoenselsepoort.nl">mail ons</a>.<br>Het nummer is bereikbaar op werkdagen tussen 8.30 uur tot 12.00 uur en van 13.00 uur tot 17.00 uur.</li></ul></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--text-titled read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default"
      >
          
            <h2 class="field field--name-field-text-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Overige vragen</h2>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Overige vragen: bel <a href="tel:+31402970170">(040) 297 01 70</a> of <a href="mailto:info@ggze.nl">mail ons</a>.<br>Het nummer is bereikbaar op werkdagen tussen 08.00 uur en 17.00 uur.</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--location-contactinformation read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--location-contactinformation paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-address-line-1 field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Dr. Poletlaan 40</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-address-line-2 field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">5626 ND Eindhoven</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-email field--type-email field--label-hidden field__item"><a href="mailto:info@ggze.nl">info@ggze.nl</a></div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-phonenumber field--type-telephone field--label-hidden field__item"><a href="tel:%28040%292970170">(040) 297 01 70</a></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--gmap read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--gmap paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-gmap-location field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">      <iframe width="100" height="100" title="" frameborder="0" style="border:0" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?origin=mfe&amp;pb=!1m4!2m1!1sDr.+Poletlaan+40%2C+Eindhoven!5e0!6i14!5m1!1snl"></iframe>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--text-titled read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default"
      >
          
            <h2 class="field field--name-field-text-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Afspraken</h2>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Heb je een afspraak op Landgoed De Grote Beek? Kijk op de informatieborden op het terrein voor de juiste locatie en welke parkeerroute je het beste kunt volgen.</p><p>Ook de medewerkers van de receptie kunnen je de weg wijzen op het terrein. De receptie bevindt zich bij de hoofdingang van Landgoed De Grote Beek aan de Boschdijk.</p><p>Landgoed De Grote Beek is het groene hart van Eindhoven. Er is veel ruimte voor rust en natuur en is ruim opgezet. Houd daarom rekening met enige looptijd van de parkeerplaats of bushalte naar het gebouw.</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--text-titled read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default"
      >
          
            <h2 class="field field--name-field-text-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Parkeren</h2>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Er zijn diverse parkeerplaatsen op Landgoed De Grote Beek. Bij de ingangen van het landgoed kun je op de informatieborden kijken welke parkeerroute je het beste kunt volgen.</p></div>
      
      <div class="field field--name-field-references field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--download paragraph--view-mode--sidebar">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-download-media field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><article class="media media--type-document media--view-mode-download">
  
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-file field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item">
<span class="file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf"> <a href="/sites/default/files/media/2018-11/documents/parkeerreglement_ggze_juli2018.pdf" type="application/pdf" title="parkeerreglement_ggze_juli2018.pdf">Parkeerreglement</a></span>
</div>
      
  </article>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--text-titled read field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default"
      >
          
            <h2 class="field field--name-field-text-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Postadres</h2>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>GGzE<br>Postbus 909<br>5600 AX Eindhoven</p><p>AGB-code: 06291003<br>RSIN: 818330776<br>BTW-nummer: 810415343.B01<br>KvK-nummer: 17141715</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item--link-list read field__item">  <div class="paragraph--lightblue paragraph--2-columns-with-desc paragraph paragraph--type--link-list paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <h2 class="field field--name-field-link-list-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">Contactgegevens organisatieonderdelen</h2>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-link-list-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Kijk bij het betreffende organisatieonderdeel voor de eigen contactgegevens.</p></div>
      
